---
// For Guides Section
---

<section id="for-guides" class="for-guides section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Built for Algarve birding guides.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      Save time after every walk and give guests a professional memory of the tour.
    </p>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⏱️</div>
        <h3>Save time</h3>
        <p>Reports are generated from observations, not written from scratch.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⭐</div>
        <h3>Look professional</h3>
        <p>Guests receive a polished report with species, route, photos and notes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔁</div>
        <h3>Reuse tours</h3>
        <p>Create templates for regular walks, private tours and hotel experiences.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="for-guides-cta">
      <a href="#guide-program" class="btn btn-primary">Join the Guide Program</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .for-guides {
    background-color: #FAF7EF;
  }

  .for-guides h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #5E6B60;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid #E8DFD3;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: #2F7D32;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(47, 125, 50, 0.08);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    color: #2F7D32;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: #5E6B60;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .for-guides-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
